  "description": "Babylonica is a dry brush style with hand written calligraphic brush characteristics. It's italicized approach is sometimes interrupted by upright or even back-slanted forms giving it an interrupted stress. This stress gives Babylonica that truly hand lettered appeal. It comes with Latin Character sets including Western, Central, and Vietnamese language support. To contribute, see github.com/googlefonts/babylonica .",
